      "title": "Season Kickoff",
      "phase": "INITIALIZATION",
      "status": "INIT",
      "notes": "The 2026 FTC season has officially started. The team gathered to watch the game reveal, analyze the challenge, and begin strategic discussions about robot design priorities. Initial analysis suggests the game rewards both precision scoring and efficient cycle times. The team is debating three distinct robot concepts before committing to a design direction. ENGINEERING NOTE: No design commitment has been made. This is intentional. Premature commitment to a concept is how teams end up rebuilding in Week 5.",
